			"Message": "docs(Vine): Refine documentation and update in Vine gRPC layer\n\nStreamline and update module documentation across DevLog, Error, Host, Library, and Multiplexer to reflect current implementation. Remove outdated synthesis comments and clarify the role of each module. The Multiplexer documentation is updated to reflect that reverse-RPC and cancellation are handled but currently no-op, preserving equivalence with the unary fallback path.\n\nNo functional changes. Impact: improved documentation clarity for Vine consumers.",
